#: How many material records sharing a formula the champion scan reads. Bounded
#: because a formula can carry many records; ordered by pk so the bound is
#: deterministic rather than dependent on Meta ordering, which does not totally
#: order duplicates of one formula.
CHAMPION_MATERIAL_SCAN = 50

#: How many records one comparison may list. `polymorph=True` and a
#: multi-formula comparison are unbounded in principle (the corpus holds over a
#: hundred MP entries for some formulas), and every row is a line in the prompt.
#: The number of records omitted is always stated.
